    "founder_story": {
      "type": "glow-editorial-split",
      "blocks": {
        "eyebrow": {
          "type": "eyebrow",
          "settings": {
            "text": "THE STORY"
          }
        },
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "14 years behind the chair",
            "tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "subheading": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "She saw the good, the bad and the frizzy — then built the fix."
          }
        },
        "body": {
          "type": "body",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>As a hairstylist, salon owner, and educator with more than 14 years in the industry, Marissa has seen it all — the good, the bad, and the frizzy of haircare tools.</p><p>As the creator of <strong>The Glow Method</strong>, she specializes in blonding, extensions, and shadowing — working with clients and stylists across the country. The more chairs she sat behind and the more stylists she trained, the more she noticed the same gap in every salon and bathroom: tools that worked never looked the part, and tools that looked beautiful never performed.</p><p>Glow Beauty was born to close that gap — pro-grade tools that perform like they belong in a salon and look like they belong on a vanity.</p>"
          }
        },
        "button": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Shop the lineup",
            "link": "shopify://collections/all",
            "button_style": "btn--secondary"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["eyebrow", "heading", "subheading", "body", "button"],
      "settings": {
