    "philosophy": {
      "type": "glow-editorial-split",
      "blocks": {
        "eyebrow": {
          "type": "eyebrow",
          "settings": {
            "text": "THE PHILOSOPHY"
          }
        },
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Beauty products should be beautiful.",
            "tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "subheading": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Form meets function — never one without the other."
          }
        },
        "body": {
          "type": "body",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Hair stylists are visual people. So why is it that most hair tools don't feel like they belong in a salon?</p><p>Every Glow Beauty product is designed with stylists and their clients in mind. We obsess over the details most brands skip — the weight in your hand, the drainage hole on the wet brush, the metal bristles that actually exfoliate the scalp, the finish that still looks beautiful six months in.</p><p>Form meets function. Tools professionals can take pride in, and clients can't put down.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["eyebrow", "heading", "subheading", "body"],
      "settings": {
        "image": "",
        "focal_point": "image_presentation",
        "image_position": "right",
        "mobile_order": "image_first",
        "show_band": false,
