    "values": {
      "type": "glow-story-stack",
      "blocks": {
        "moment_1": {
          "type": "moment",
          "settings": {
            "image": "",
            "focal_point": "image_presentation",
            "reverse": false,
            "eyebrow": "01 / PERFORMANCE",
            "heading": "Built behind the chair, tested everywhere else.",
            "body": "<p>Every brush is engineered with a working stylist's checklist: glides through wet or dry hair without pulling, exfoliates the scalp on the way through, lifts oils and product buildup, and survives daily use without falling apart.</p>",
            "link": "shopify://collections/all",
            "link_text": "Shop the brushes",
            "button_style": "btn--callout"
          }
        },
        "moment_2": {
          "type": "moment",
          "settings": {
            "image": "",
            "focal_point": "image_presentation",
            "reverse": true,
            "eyebrow": "02 / DESIGN",
            "heading": "Made to live on the counter, not hidden in a drawer.",
            "body": "<p>Quiet color palettes. Considered weight. Real metal, not plastic that warps after a year. We designed Glow to be the tool you reach for first and the one you're proud to leave out.</p>",
            "link": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "button_style": "btn--callout"
          }
        },
        "moment_3": {
          "type": "moment",
          "settings": {
            "image": "",
            "focal_point": "image_presentation",
            "reverse": false,
            "eyebrow": "03 / COMMUNITY",
            "heading": "For stylists and the clients who trust them.",
            "body": "<p>Glow is sold in salons across the country and used in The Glow Method curriculum. Stylists get pro pricing and dedicated support; clients get the same tools their colorist swears by — without the gatekeeping.</p>",
            "link": "/pages/salon",
            "link_text": "Salon partners",
            "button_style": "btn--callout"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["moment_1", "moment_2", "moment_3"],
      "settings": {
        "heading": "What we build for",
        "subheading": "<p>Three things we don't compromise on — ever.</p>",
        "background": "#faf6f1",
